WEBVTT

NOTE English translation reviewed against a Whisper-generated Swedish transcript.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.460
Okay, we need to talk.

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.120
Lately, I've been walking around town
and seeing menus.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.030
And on these menus, there are no longer
real photos of food.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:11.920
More and more of them are AI-generated.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.460
This has to stop.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:19.720
I understand that sometimes you use AI
because you can't afford a photographer.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:25.160
But the problem is, it doesn't look good.
I mean, it just doesn't.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.180
So I'm saying this to all of Sweden—

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.740
to all the wonderful restaurateurs out there:

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.940
If you feel the need to AI-generate an image,
just skip it.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.200
It looks so much better—real and authentic—
without those AI images.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:42.300
Have you noticed more AI-generated images?

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:45.680
Comment if you're tired of them too,
because this has to stop.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.380
That's it.
